*.md
# pyproject.toml declares `readme = "README.md"`, and uv_build reads it when it installs the
# project itself -- so excluding it fails the build with "failed to open file /app/README.md".
# `docs` is already excluded above, so this exception pulls in nothing else.
!README.md
